{
  "file": "common childhood",
  "page": 89,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        118.58090209960938,
        27.289522171020508,
        334.9440002441406,
        35.34652328491211
      ],
      "text": "10. EVIDENCE FOR RECOMMENDATIONS ON THE OXYGEN USE AND DELIVERY",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        59.74208068847656,
        399.0728454589844,
        73.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "Patients using a nasopharyngeal catheter should be closely monitored, as they are",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        72.74208068847656,
        374.7727966308594,
        86.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "likely to develop serious complications (e.g. catheter entering the oesophagus).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        97.26070404052734,
        231.48292541503906,
        109.25070190429688
      ],
      "text": "10.5.1\t Evidence and summary of findings",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        112.91542053222656,
        399.1229553222656,
        126.4054183959961
      ],
      "text": "A systematic review [Rigau, 2010] identified four relevant studies. Overall, there is",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        125.91542053222656,
        399.1228332519531,
        139.40542602539062
      ],
      "text": "moderate quality evidence that nasal prongs and catheters are equivalent in terms",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        138.91542053222656,
        399.0228271484375,
        152.40542602539062
      ],
      "text": "of treatment failure and flow rates. There is high quality evidence for a lower risk",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        151.91542053222656,
        399.0928955078125,
        165.40542602539062
      ],
      "text": "of nasal obstruction/severe mucous production with nasal prongs compared to",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        258.1836853027344,
        164.6953887939453,
        356.99359130859375,
        178.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "see GRADE table A7.30",
      "font": "MinionPro-Semibold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        164.91539001464844,
        399.1077880859375,
        178.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "catheters (relative risk 0.18, 95% CI 0.08 to 0.43) ( ). There is",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        177.91539001464844,
        399.042724609375,
        191.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "very low quality evidence that the use of a head-box or face mask is associated with",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        295.93109130859375,
        190.6953887939453,
        392.010986328125,
        204.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "see GRADE table A7.31",
      "font": "MinionPro-Semibold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        190.91539001464844,
        399.1164855957031,
        204.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "lower rates of treatment failure (RR 0.4, 95% CI 0.34 to 0.5) ( ).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.69300079345703,
        203.91539001464844,
        399.11297607421875,
        217.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "However, these methods required four times higher flow rate (4 l/min) than catheters",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.69300079345703,
        216.91539001464844,
        123.3329849243164,
        230.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "or nasal prongs.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        229.91539001464844,
        399.1213684082031,
        243.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "Treatment failure was measured as the number of hypoxaemic episodes during",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.69300079345703,
        242.91539001464844,
        399.11407470703125,
        256.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "therapy, or the time or flow required to achieve adequate SpO . Complications",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        327.59259033203125,
        250.20130920410156,
        330.47259521484375,
        258.2953186035156
      ],
      "text": "2",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 6.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.69300079345703,
        255.91539001464844,
        399.0730285644531,
        269.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "assessed were mucous production, nasal ulceration, intolerance, nasal obstruction,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.69300079345703,
        268.9153747558594,
        283.64300537109375,
        282.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "and abdominal distension (secondary to dislodgement).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        281.9153747558594,
        399.0615234375,
        295.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "Three studies (399 children) compared nasal prongs with nasal or nasopharyngeal",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.69300079345703,
        294.9153747558594,
        399.03271484375,
        308.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "catheters. There was no difference in treatment failure (RR 0.96, 95% CI 0.51 to 1.78)",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.69300079345703,
        307.9153747558594,
        399.14288330078125,
        321.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "or mean flow rates required (standard mean difference 0.08, 95% CI -0.14 to 0.29).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.69300079345703,
        320.9153747558594,
        399.0931701660156,
        334.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "In one study [Muhe 1998], treatment failure for nasal catheters was not significantly",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.69300079345703,
        333.9153747558594,
        399.0831298828125,
        347.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "different to that of nasal prongs (p = 0.64). There was a significantly lower risk of nasal",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.69300079345703,
        346.9153747558594,
        399.0428771972656,
        360.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "obstruction when prongs were used (RR 0.18, 95% CI 0.08 to 0.43), but no significant",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.69300079345703,
        359.9153747558594,
        236.93304443359375,
        373.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "difference in nasal ulceration or discomfort.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        372.9153747558594,
        399.1313781738281,
        386.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "Only one study assessed face-masks and head-box. These methods required a",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.69300079345703,
        385.9153747558594,
        399.0429382324219,
        399.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "much higher flow (4 l/min, compared to 1 l/min for prongs and catheters). The risk of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.69300079345703,
        398.9153747558594,
        396.8194274902344,
        412.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "treatment failure (PaO  ≤ 60) was significantly lower with either a head box or a face-",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        147.71949768066406,
        406.2013244628906,
        150.59950256347656,
        414.2953186035156
      ],
      "text": "2",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 6.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.69300079345703,
        411.9153747558594,
        399.03302001953125,
        425.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "mask as compared to catheters or nasal prongs. However, this study had important",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.69300079345703,
        424.9154052734375,
        399.1329345703125,
        438.4054260253906
      ],
      "text": "limitations. It was a cross-over design, where 80 children were treated with different",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.69300079345703,
        437.9154052734375,
        399.0830383300781,
        451.4054260253906
      ],
      "text": "delivery methods sequentially, but no information was provided as to how or when",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.69300079345703,
        450.9154052734375,
        212.5530548095703,
        464.4054260253906
      ],
      "text": "children were allocated to each group.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.69300079345703,
        475.4339294433594,
        163.9629669189453,
        487.4239196777344
      ],
      "text": "10.5.2\t Benefits and risks",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.69300079345703,
        491.07861328125,
        88.77300262451172,
        503.2185974121094
      ],
      "text": "Benefits",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.69300079345703,
        504.088623046875,
        399.10308837890625,
        517.57861328125
      ],
      "text": "As compared to a face-mask or head-box, prongs and catheters are less expensive,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.69300079345703,
        517.088623046875,
        395.3530578613281,
        530.57861328125
      ],
      "text": "easier to use, more available, require lower flow rates, and conserve oxygen supplies.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        530.088623046875,
        399.071533203125,
        543.57861328125
      ],
      "text": "As compared to catheters, nasal prongs have a lower risk of nasal obstruction",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.69300079345703,
        543.0885620117188,
        399.1229553222656,
        556.5785522460938
      ],
      "text": "or excessive mucous production, are easier to apply, and do not require humidified",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.69300079345703,
        556.0885620117188,
        88.04300689697266,
        569.5785522460938
      ],
      "text": "oxygen.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.69300079345703,
        577.5824584960938,
        78.65299987792969,
        589.7224731445312
      ],
      "text": "Risks",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.69300079345703,
        590.5924682617188,
        396.8505859375,
        604.0824584960938
      ],
      "text": "Oesophageal placement of nasopharyngeal catheters, nasal ulceration, and obstruc­",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.69300079345703,
        603.5924682617188,
        77.7129898071289,
        617.0824584960938
      ],
      "text": "tion.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        223.46099853515625,
        644.9403076171875,
        231.57899475097656,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "75",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}